  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Safety by design Campaign</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the campaign is to bring a new narrative and shape&amp;nbsp;EU policy discussions in Brussels and the Netherlands around the&amp;nbsp;proposed&amp;nbsp; CSA Regulation towards ensuring strong child safety by design&amp;nbsp;requirements to prevent OCSE and identify grooming and CSAMproactively.&amp;nbsp;The campaign will target both policymakers as well as the general public. We aim to grow the support of children, parents and anyone that is concerned about the online safety of children to the CSAregulation, in order to influence decision makers.</narrative>
  </description>
